      224.25,
      377.05,
      363.45,
      388.12
    ],
    "text": "Direction under Section 12(2)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      401.05,
      538.99,
      472.12
    ],
    "text": "ACTING under the powers vested in it by Section 12(2) of the Consumer Affairs Authority Act, No. 09 of 2003, theConsumer Affairs Authority directs all Manufacturers, Importers, Distributors and Traders that they shall not manufacture,import, distribute, store or sell or display for sale, expose for sale or offer for sale, wholesale or retail any item/s oflocally manufactured and/or imported protective helmets for vehicle users classified below, unless such helmets bear theSLS product certification mark issued by the Sri Lanka Standards Institution, against the Sri Lanka Standard Specificationfor protective helmets for vehicle users (SLS 517).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      485.05,
      538.96,
      496.12
    ],
    "text": "Type A-intended for competitive events and for use by wearers who demand an especially high degree of protection",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      509.05,
      366.6,
      520.12
    ],
    "text": "Type B-intended for the ordinary motor cycle riders on public roads",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      533.05,
      325.33,
      544.12
    ],
    "text": "This Direction shall come into effect from 1st of September 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      557.05,
      412.51,
      568.12
    ],
